OL,3,GNEWSACity centre maple tree felling
OL,4,Aplan to be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tree's felling as part of
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound plans for a city
OL,8,Fcentre building has been put on hold
OL,9,Fafter concerns were raised by
OL,10,Fcampaigners.
OL,12,FThe mature maple tree outside
OL,13,FPlymouth's Civic Centre had been
OL,14,Fearmarked for removal to allow a
OL,15,Fwheelchair ramp at the site which is at
OL,16,Fthe centre of a #47m project to develop
OL,17,Fapartments and a college campus.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
