OL,3,GNEWSACity centre maple tree felling
OL,4,Aplan to be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaign group STRAW (Save the Trees of
OL,7,FArmada Way) wrote to Plymouth City
OL,8,FCouncil asking it to hold off axing the
OL,9,Ftree until there had been time to
OL,10,Funderstand why it could not be
OL,11,Fretained.
OL,13,FThe council confirmed it would take
OL,14,Fanother look at whether alternative
OL,15,Foptions had been considered, the Local
OL,16,FDemocracy Reporting Service said.
